{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47523","headline":"七言 三十二 · 吕岩","name":"七言 三十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲陪仙侣得身轻，飞过蓬莱彻上清。\n朱顶鹤来云外接，紫鳞鱼向海中迎。\n姮娥月桂花先吐，王母仙桃子渐成。\n下瞰日轮天欲晓，定知人世久长生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47523.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47523","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}